pener noreferrer">Autodesk Forma construction document management</a> · <a href="https://www.oracle.com/construction-engineering/aconex/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Oracle Aconex</a>. Requirements below are X-Ray targets.</p></div><article class="requirement" data-search="a-01 organization workspaces two companies cannot read each other&#39;s project records"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-01</div><div><strong>Organization workspaces</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Two companies cannot read each other&#39;s project records.</p><small class="muted">State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). No account service is selected and authentication ships disabled by default, so this row cannot be assessed. There is no organisation or tenant model; project records are local to one profile.</small></div><span class="state">dependency-blocked</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="a-02 individual sign-in and sign-out sign-out removes access and cached private views"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-02</div><div><strong>Individual sign-in and sign-out</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Sign-out removes access and cached private views.</p><small class="muted">State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). A Better Auth server with federated providers exists but ships disabled, email and password sign-in is switched off in code and no sign-in or sign-out forms are built (`src/lib/auth/`). With authentication off the app resolves a development identity, so sign-out behaviour cannot be assessed.</small></div><span class="state">dependency-blocked</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="a-03 staff invitations an accepted invitation grants only the invited role"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-03</div><div><strong>Staff invitations</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: An accepted invitation grants only the invited role.</p><small class="muted">State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). No account service is selected and authentication ships disabled by default, so this row cannot be assessed. There is no invitation model.</small></div><span class="state">dependency-blocked</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="a-04 project roles viewer cannot edit; estimator cannot approve engineering"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-04</div><div><strong>Project roles</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Viewer cannot edit; estimator cannot approve engineering.</p><small class="muted">State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). No account service is selected and authentication ships disabled by default, so this row cannot be assessed. There is no project role model. The assistant permission mode governs tool execution, not user roles, and must not be read as satisfying this row.</small></div><span class="state">dependency-blocked</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="a-05 document and field permissions restricted rates remain hidden in screens and exports"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-05</div><div><strong>Document and field permissions</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Restricted rates remain hidden in screens and exports.</p><small class="muted">State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). No account service is selected and authentication ships disabled by default, so this row cannot be assessed. There is no field-level permission, so restricted rates cannot be hidden in screens or exports.</small></div><span class="state">dependency-blocked</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="a-06 external guest access guest sees only explicitly shared packages"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>A-06</div><div><strong>External guest access</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Guest