ette and shortcuts</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Common commands work from keyboard and show discoverable labels.</p><small class="muted">State: partial. Navigation milestone verified 2026-09-08; full row remains open. Code/proof: [Stage07 scoped results, source diff and executed evidence](proof/growth/2026-09-08-07-walkthrough-release/index.html). Latest bounded milestone: [Stage09 clean plans, boundaries, body reach and release evidence](proof/growth/2026-09-08-09-walkthrough-polish/index.html); full row stays open.</small></div><span class="state">partial</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="u-03 resizable panels and saved layouts layout restores on the user&#39;s monitor without hiding actions"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>U-03</div><div><strong>Resizable panels and saved layouts</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Layout restores on the user&#39;s monitor without hiding actions.</p><small class="muted">State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Panels resize and persist: the assistant panel resizes from four corners and can dock into the right rail, the Magic Pencil dock is draggable and clamped back into view on resize, and top menu rows resize with saved layout (`src/studio/assistant/panelCorners.ts`, `draftsmanDockPosition.ts`, `assistantRailMode.ts`; SC-07, SC-14, SC-18). Remaining: layouts are per browser profile and no multi-monitor case is covered.</small></div><span class="state">partial</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="u-04 large plan/model navigation representative heavy fixture meets recorded load and interaction budget"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>U-04</div><div><strong>Large plan/model navigation</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Representative heavy fixture meets recorded load and interaction budget.</p><small class="muted">State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Heavy fixtures are exercised in practice: a 