 <section><h2>Benchmark source register</h2><p>Established vendor suites and specialist tools provide comparison coverage. This is not a market-share ranking. Version, license and platform limits must be checked when implementing an adapter.</p><p class="source"><strong>ACAD</strong> · <a href="https://www.autodesk.com/products/autocad" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Autodesk AutoCAD</a> — 2D/3D drafting and seven discipline toolsets, including plant and raster workflows.</p><p class="source"><strong>REVIT</strong> · <a href="https://help.autodesk.com/cloudhelp/2026/ENU/Revit-MEPEng/files/GUID-195C2C6C-5E2C-422E-A44D-FB3FDFDE276A.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Autodesk Revit MEP documentation</a> — Ducts, circuits, piping and connected building-services systems.</p><p class="source"><strong>ARCHICAD</strong> · <a href="https://www.graphisoft.com/en-us/plans-and-products/archicad-collaborate/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Graphisoft Archicad Collaborate</a> — Architecture and MEP authoring, BIMcloud teamwork and BIMx presentation.</p><p class="source"><strong>BIMCLOUD</strong> · <a href="https://helpcenter.graphisoft.com/user-guide/134439/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Graphisoft BIMcloud teams</a> — Teams and permissions across project participants.</p><p class="source"><strong>OPENBUILD</strong> · <a href="https://www.bentley.com/software/openbuildings-designer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bentley OpenBuildings Designer</a> — Multidiscipline building modeling, documentation and analysis workflows.</p><p class="source"><strong>CIVIL</strong> · <a href="https://www.autodesk.com/uk/products/civil-3d/features" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Autodesk Civil 3D</a> — Survey, surfaces, corridors, pressure networks and civil documentation.</p><p class="source"><strong>OPENSITE</strong> · <a href="https://www.bentley.com/software/opensite-designer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bentley OpenSite Designer</a> — Site layout, grading, earthworks and site utility design.</p><p class="source"><strong>TRIMBLE</strong> · <a href="https://civilconstruction.trimble.com/en/products/software/trimble-business-center" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trimble Business Center</a> — Field data, earthwork takeoff, corridors and machine-control models.</p><p class="source"><strong>TBC</strong> · <a href="https://help.fieldsystems.trimble.com/tbc/pdf/tbc-command-matrix-editions-modules.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trimble Business Center command matrix</a> — Published edition matrix, October 2025: network adjustment, COGO, surfaces and survey drafting.</p><p class="source"><strong>GIS</strong> · <a href="https://www.esri.com/en-us/arcgis/products/arcgis-pro/features" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Esri ArcGIS Pro</a> — Spatial analysis, imagery, geoprocessing and extensibility.</p><p class="source"><strong>ETABS</strong> · <a href="https://www.csiamerica.com/products/etabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CSI ETABS</a> — Building structural modeling, analysis, design and reporting.</p><p class="source"><strong>TEDDS</strong> · <a href="https://www.tekla.com/products/tekla-tedds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tekla Tedds</a> — Documented structural calculations across materials.</p><p class="source"><strong>PLAXIS</strong> · <a href="https://www.bentley.com/products/plaxis-3d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bentley PLAXIS 3D</a> — Soil/structure interaction, staged excavation, groundwater and dynamic analysis.</p><p class="source"><strong>WATER</strong> · <a href="https://www.bentley.com/products/openflows-water" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bentley OpenFlows Water</a> — Water-network scenarios, fire flow, water quality and transient analysis.</p><p class="source"><strong>LANDMARK</strong> · <a href="https://www.vectorworks.net/en-GB/design-suite" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vectorworks Design Suite</a> — Architecture, landscape and entertainment design disciplines.</p><p class="source"><strong>RIGGING</strong> · <a href="https://www.vectorworks.net/en-CA/braceworks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vectorworks Braceworks</a> — Temporary entertainment structure load analysis and engineer review workflows.</p><p class="source"><strong>SOLID</strong> · <a href="https://www.solidworks.com/product/solidworks-design" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SOLIDWORKS Design</a> — Parts, assemblies, drawings, sheet metal, weldments and manufacturing connections.</p><p class="source"><strong>NX</strong> · <a href="https://blogs.sw.siemens.com/nx-manufacturing/whats-new-in-nx-for-manufacturing-2606-june-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Siemens NX Manufacturing</a> — June 2026 release covers CAM, additive manufacturing, probing and production data management.</p><p class="source"><strong>EPLAN</strong> · <a href="https://www.eplan.com/de-en/products/eplan-electric-p8/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eplan Electric P8</a> — Electrical schematics, cross references, device data, wire lists and ERP/PDM connections.</p><p class="source"><strong>AVEVA</strong> · <a href="https://www.aveva.com/en/products/unified-engineering/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AVEVA Unified Engineering</a> — Shared 1D/2D/3D engineering information and continuous asset handover.</p><p class="source"><strong>IES</strong> · <a href="https://www.iesve.com/software/virtual-environment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IES Virtual Environment</a> — Building energy and environmental performance, daylight and lighting design.</p><p class="source"><strong>LCA</strong> · <a href="https://oneclicklca.com/en-be/software/design-construction" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">One Click LCA</a> — Embodied-carbon assessment from early design through construction.</p><p class="source"><strong>LCC</strong> · <a href="https://oneclicklca.com/en-gb/software/design-construction/life-cycle-costing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">One Click LCA life-cycle costing</a> — Construction, operating, maintenance and replacement cost assessment.</p><p class="source"><strong>COSTX</strong> · <a href="https://www.rib-software.com/en/rib-costx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RIB CostX</a> — 2D/3D takeoff, revision comparison, rate databases and linked estimating workbooks.</p><p class="source"><strong>BLUEBEAM</strong> · <a href="https://www.bluebeam.com/product/markups-and-data/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluebeam markups and data</a> — Measurements and markups with statuses, custom fields and structured exports.</p><p class="source"><strong>PROCORE</strong> · <a href="https://www.procore.com/project-management" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Procore Project Management</a> — Drawings, RFIs, submittals, daily reporting and team workflows.</p><p class="source"><strong>FORMA</strong> · <a href="https://construction.autodesk.com/workflows/construction-document-management/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Autodesk Forma construction document management</a> — Document organization, distribution and permission controls. Current page notes the Autodesk Construction Cloud name transition.</p><p class="source"><strong>ACONEX</strong> · <a href="https://www.oracle.com/construction-engineering/aconex/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Oracle Aconex</a> — Document packages connected to reviews, communications, approvals and history.</p><p class="source"><strong>MAXIMO</strong> · <a href="https://www.ibm.com/products/maximo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IBM Maximo</a> — Asset history, maintenance, inspections, condition and investment planning.</p><p class="source"><strong>BCF</strong> · <a href="https://www.buildingsmart.org/standards/bsi-standards/bim-collaboration-format/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buildingSMART BCF</a> — Open model-issue exchange. This is a standard, not a competing application.</p><p class="source"><strong>IDS</strong> · <a href="https://www.buildingsmart.org/standards/bsi-standards/information-delivery-specification-ids/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buildingSMART IDS</a> — Machine-readable information requirements and IFC checking.</p><p class="source"><strong>FIRECRAWL</strong> · <a href="https://docs.firecrawl.dev/api-reference/endpoint/search" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Firecrawl v2 search API</a> — Search with optional page scraping, geographic filters and bounded result counts. Supplier prices still require interpretation and review.</p><p class="source"><strong>DWG</strong> · <a href="https://github.com/DomCR/ACadSharp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ACadSharp</a> — MIT-licensed CAD library evaluated locally for bounded Windows DWG exchange.</p></section><footer>Scope remains expandable. New specialist use cases require explicit acceptance and evidence before an industry-readiness claim. Generated from the versioned catalogue; checklist marks cannot be changed by clicking this report.</footer></main><script>
